Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.59,0:01:56.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tsunami! A tsunami is coming!
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.46,0:01:58.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What is it now?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.63,0:02:00.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What's the matter, Luffy?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.40,0:02:02.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Maybe it wasn't really such a good idea.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.77,0:02:04.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What wasn't a good idea?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:04.07,0:02:06.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I warned him, but he didn't listen.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.43,0:02:08.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He said he was so thirsty he couldn't stand it anymore,
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.71,0:02:10.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,so he chomped down on some of\Nthat cactus growing back there
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.05,0:02:12.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to suck out the moisture.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:12.72,0:02:13.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cactus?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.91,0:02:16.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yep, right there.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.19,0:02:17.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those round things.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.21,0:02:18.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A tsunami!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:18.66,0:02:21.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ah! You gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.20,0:02:22.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those are mezcal cacti;
Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.73,0:02:24.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,they're used to make\Nhallucinogenic drugs!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.64,0:02:25.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:30.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look out! We're gonna drown!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.33,0:02:33.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right! Bring it on\Nif you got the guts!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.27,0:02:34.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll beat you all up!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:38.52,0:02:40.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.29,0:02:41.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.33,0:02:46.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Heh. Knock-out!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.20,0:02:48.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Chopper.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.58,0:02:51.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The operation will\Nbegin at the stroke of noon
Dialogue: 50,0:02:51.79,0:02:53.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,two days from now.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.39,0:02:55.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have you completed the arrangements?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.42,0:02:58.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. Everything's in place.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.09,0:02:59.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We have a hundred\Nand fifty Billions
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.89,0:03:02.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who are standing by in Nanohana.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.83,0:03:05.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've also called\NMister Two back here.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.63,0:03:07.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It appears that he failed\Nutterly in his assignment
Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.86,0:03:10.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to capture and\Nkill Mister Three.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.48,0:03:12.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The officer agents have been instructed
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.48,0:03:15.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to gather tonight, at eight o'clock.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:15.52,0:03:17.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're meeting\Nat the Spiders Café.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.02,0:03:23.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. Very good.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.43,0:03:25.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's already past five o'clock.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.54,0:03:27.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I would imagine that the officer agents
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.07,0:03:29.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,will begin gathering at\Nthe café any minute now.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:47.98,0:03:49.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, well! Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.65,0:03:51.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas!\NThat was an exhausting trip!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.77,0:03:54.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My back is really killing me here!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.06,0:03:56.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is your fault, Mister Four!\NYou're so slow!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.63,0:03:58.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we had gotten here quicker,\Nmy back wouldn't hurt right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.01,0:04:03.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh... I'm... sorry...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.93,0:04:06.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes, yes! How's\Nbusiness these days, Paula?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.65,0:04:08.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The place sure is empty today!\NIt's an empty place.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.54,0:04:11.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Place. Empty.\NPlace empty. Plempty!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.20,0:04:13.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, it is certainly\Ngood to see you again.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.64,0:04:16.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Miss Merry Christmas\Nand you, Mister Four.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.87,0:04:19.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You will have the shop all to yourselves for a while.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.81,0:04:21.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can go ahead and\Nbrew some tea for you
Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.58,0:04:23.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if you don't mind waiting a few minutes
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.11,0:04:26.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for it to steep. Is it chamomile\Nas usual, Mister Four?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.34,0:04:27.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! I don't wanna\Nwait for tea!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.85,0:04:29.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I want something I can drink right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.15,0:04:31.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something fast! Right away!\NRight away! No waiting!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.29,0:04:32.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right now, okay, got it?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.86,0:04:34.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You seem to be in good spirits.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.70,0:04:36.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is work going well for you right now?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.17,0:04:38.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In my line of work,\Nif you don't do well, you die.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:38.11,0:04:40.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So obviously, it's going well.\NYou stupid woman.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:40.21,0:04:42.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stupid woman. Stuman! Stuman!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.95,0:04:45.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course, how forgetful of me.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.22,0:04:46.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:47.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Un, deux.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.25,0:04:48.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Ora!\N– Ora!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.15,0:04:49.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Un, deux.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.72,0:04:51.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is that noise?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.26,0:04:53.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What kind of crazy\Nsingers are you using
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.01,0:04:55.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in this place these\Ndays, anyhow?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.35,0:04:56.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Singers?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.35,0:04:59.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, I have a classical sonata playing right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.09,0:05:02.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are no words.\NThere shouldn't be any singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:03.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Un, deux.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.69,0:05:04.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Ora!\N– Ora!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.02,0:05:06.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:07.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Un, deux.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:07.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Krah!\N– Krah!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.50,0:05:08.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}Head in the clouds,\Nand feet on the ground
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.78,0:05:10.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}and un, deux!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.89,0:05:11.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Krah!\N– Krah!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.79,0:05:13.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}Fly like a fish in a stream.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.32,0:05:14.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}Un, deux.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.66,0:05:15.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}– Ora!\N– Ora!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.83,0:05:19.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}Spin! Just remember!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.33,0:05:20.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}Spin!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:21.60,0:05:22.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}Spin!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.27,0:05:25.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}Pretty shoes!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.96,0:05:28.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}And mascara!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.12,0:05:31.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}Pretty shoes and mascara!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.62,0:05:38.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}– I'm such a lovely dancing boy!\N– I'm such a lovely dancing boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.11,0:05:41.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}Now! We say!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:41.91,0:05:42.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}Switch foot!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.98,0:05:43.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}– Switch foot!\N– Switch foot!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.95,0:05:44.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}And up!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.93,0:05:46.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}– And up!\N– And up!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.13,0:05:49.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}And now! Leap away!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.80,0:05:51.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}Let's hear you boys sing it!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.71,0:05:52.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}Mascara!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.57,0:05:53.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}And shoes!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.34,0:05:54.20,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25}And a...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.20,0:05:55.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...tu-tu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:06:00.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Oh! Dance away!\N– Oh! Dance away!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.32,0:05:58.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25\t(3277,0,1,\c&H000000&)}Dance...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.22,0:05:59.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25\t(3277,0,1,\c&H000000&)}Away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.15,0:06:06.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hello to all!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.65,0:06:09.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And how are deux today?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.12,0:06:10.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:11.02,0:06:12.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're a freak.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.12,0:06:14.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am not a freak, Paula!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.46,0:06:17.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I am merely a talented\Ndancer practicing my craft.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.46,0:06:19.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will take one sparkling water, please.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.43,0:06:20.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't have any.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.43,0:06:22.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't have any?\NGimme a break!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:22.25,0:06:24.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what all the high-class\Nballerinas drink!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:26.40,0:06:27.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're still here?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.66,0:06:29.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You guys can leave now.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.08,0:06:30.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Right!\N– Right!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:30.14,0:06:31.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And don't forget to\Npractice those new
Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.41,0:06:33.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,dance moves like\Nwe talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.51,0:06:36.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Right! Un, deux, un, deux.\N– Right! Un, deux, un, deux.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.41,0:06:35.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25\t(3277,0,1,\c&H000000&)}UN...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.48,0:06:35.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25\t(3277,0,1,\c&H000000&)}De...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.70,0:06:36.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\b1\bord3.375\shad2.7\fnFOT-Greco Std B Strp\fs74.25\t(3277,0,1,\c&H000000&)}UN...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:36.74,0:06:37.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How nice.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.74,0:06:39.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The fatty and the\Nold hag are here with us.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.65,0:06:41.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just shut your fat mouth,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.44,0:06:43.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you weirdo ballet-dancing,\Nswan-wearing
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.39,0:06:44.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,freak of nature!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.33,0:06:46.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well! Nice to see you!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.56,0:06:47.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.43,0:06:49.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It seems like even\NMister One's team
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.04,0:06:50.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,is being mobilized\Nfor this assignment.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.01,0:06:52.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never actually had the pleasure
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.38,0:06:55.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of meeting him and his partner.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.05,0:06:56.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm really very excited!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.08,0:07:04.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's a little something I wanted you to have.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.92,0:07:05.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:08.45,0:07:12.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do yourself a favor\Nand hang onto that.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.06,0:07:14.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But it's just a scrap of paper.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.26,0:07:16.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That paper will\Nreunite us some day.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.40,0:07:20.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd tuck it away somewhere.\NFor safe keeping.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:20.94,0:07:22.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What ya don't want it?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.61,0:07:24.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, I do.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.11,0:07:27.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's perfectly natural for a guy to worry...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.82,0:07:30.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...about his\Nbungling kid brother.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:30.75,0:07:34.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He might be a bit much\Nfor all of you to handle...
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.15,0:07:37.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...but take good\Ncare of him for me.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.42,0:07:40.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait. You're leaving already?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.10,0:07:47.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, when next we meet,\Nwe'll both be top pirates.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.00,0:08:11.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:12.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.84,0:08:14.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was that thing\Nyour brother gave you?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.60,0:08:16.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't really know.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.24,0:08:18.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just looks like a scrap of paper.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.71,0:08:19.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's just paper?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.81,0:08:20.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Lemme see it.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.00,0:08:25.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like it really\Nis just a piece of paper.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.12,0:08:27.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's nothing written on it or anything.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.74,0:08:31.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that all? Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.74,0:08:33.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not really sure\Nwhy Ace gave it to me,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.66,0:08:35.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but it's important. Ah...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.23,0:08:37.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wahh...!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.66,0:08:39.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't eat that!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.02,0:08:42.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dumb camel.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.02,0:08:43.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy. Give me your hat.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.72,0:08:44.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:44.70,0:08:46.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If it's really\Nthat important to you,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.34,0:08:48.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can sew it to the underside of your hat ribbon.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.57,0:08:50.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good idea!\NSew it on real good!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.66,0:08:51.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.23,0:08:55.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There, it's all done.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.84,0:08:57.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.80,0:08:59.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I don't have to worry about losing it.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.69,0:09:00.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.70,0:09:02.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If there isn't even\Nanything written on it,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:02.24,0:09:04.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,what's the point of\Nhanging onto the thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.27,0:09:06.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ace said it's important\Nand I should hang onto it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.38,0:09:08.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So I'm hanging on to it.\NThat's all.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:08.86,0:09:10.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, you're pretty much\Njust basing your decision
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.87,0:09:11.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on nothing.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.74,0:09:13.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,2420)}No, my instincts.\NThey're right a lot.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.87,0:09:18.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,2420)}Will someone please carry me?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.31,0:09:24.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Moment by moment, the night grows later.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.44,0:09:26.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We are nearing eight o'clock, the appointed time.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.69,0:09:38.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! I'm so bored!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.09,0:09:43.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Time to practice my spinning!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:43.70,0:09:45.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm bored, so I'm going for a spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.70,0:09:46.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Around and around I go.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.80,0:09:48.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit it! Just looking\Nat you hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.80,0:09:49.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's your problem,\Nyou old hag?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.02,0:09:52.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you wanna fight?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.42,0:09:54.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you really think you can handle me?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.46,0:09:56.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come, now, why don't\Nyou two cut it out?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.76,0:09:57.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:09.67,0:10:10.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.60,0:10:11.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why are you lying there on the ground
Dialogue: 50,0:10:11.77,0:10:14.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,instead of practicing like\Nyou're supposed to be doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.38,0:10:16.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We were! Until him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:18.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:18.46,0:10:21.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So these men are\Nacquaintances of yours?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.43,0:10:23.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You see, I found\Nthem acting suspicious
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:26.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,out in the desert.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.97,0:10:29.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NI doubt they'll die.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.74,0:10:32.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You seem unnecessarily concerned about them.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.98,0:10:35.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fostering friendships will only make you weaker.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.01,0:10:38.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Those men are mine!\NThey don't belong to you!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.52,0:10:40.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'd better stop, Mister Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:45.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Un. Deux. Krah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:48.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Un. Deux. Krah!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.18,0:10:55.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ball Change! Un. Deux!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.43,0:11:05.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:06.13,0:11:07.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He flew straight\Nthrough the wall!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.90,0:11:10.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He barely seemed to notice it was happening!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.70,0:11:14.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you want to die that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.77,0:11:16.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:16.72,0:11:18.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's enough playing\Naround, Mister One.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.62,0:11:19.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not done.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.71,0:11:21.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Move, Miss Doublefinger.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.86,0:11:24.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I still haven't killed him yet.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.10,0:11:25.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Come on!\NJust get off of me, fatty!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:25.96,0:11:27.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh! You're killing me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:28.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.52,0:11:30.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to\Ncalm down as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.75,0:11:31.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's eight o'clock.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.69,0:11:36.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All the agents that should be here are here.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.17,0:11:38.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's more, a letter\Ncontaining the orders
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.61,0:11:41.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,has arrived at the\NSpiders Café. So...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:43.28,0:11:45.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're instructed to head to Rainbase,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.15,0:11:47.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the city of dreams.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.62,0:11:49.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In that city, we'll meet someone.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:49.75,0:11:52.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A man we know, but whose face we have never seen.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:57.86,0:12:00.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're heading to meet the boss.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.28,0:12:08.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The officer agents should all be
Dialogue: 50,0:12:08.95,0:12:11.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on their way here\Nto Rainbase as we speak.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.28,0:12:16.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I sent Bunchi to get them.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:16.22,0:12:18.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I expect them to arrive sometime later tonight.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.29,0:12:24.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To think that\Nyou've actually been
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.63,0:12:26.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Miss Doublefinger\Nthis entire time.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.66,0:12:28.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's very interesting.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.25,0:12:32.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who knows, perhaps\NI would have told you.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.24,0:12:35.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But none of you ever\Nasked me about it.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:35.07,0:12:37.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Billions that we\Nlost in Nanohana...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.37,0:12:40.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,have you been able to find replacements?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:40.15,0:12:41.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've made the assignments
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.44,0:12:43.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for the replacements.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.34,0:12:46.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As far as contacting\Nthe new Billions,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.04,0:12:48.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've dispatched the Lizard Runners to see to that.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:55.55,0:12:57.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good to hear.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.36,0:12:59.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Things are almost ready.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.67,0:13:06.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look up ahead! I see a light.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.67,0:13:08.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does that mean\Nwe made it to Yuba?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:08.68,0:13:11.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't see with all this sand blowing everywhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.08,0:13:14.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Something here\Ndoesn't feel right.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.92,0:13:17.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong\Ndown there. I can tell.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.79,0:13:25.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.30,0:13:32.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The entire city is being\Nstruck by a sandstorm!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:46.39,0:13:47.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't be.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.23,0:13:52.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This place doesn't look much different
Dialogue: 50,0:13:54.23,0:13:56.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,from that Erumalu\Ntown from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:13:59.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.74,0:14:01.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi, I thought this city\Nwas supposed to be
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.66,0:14:02.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,some sort of oasis.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:03.00,0:14:06.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like the\Noasis has disappeared!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.47,0:14:08.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's been swallowed up\Nby all the sand!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.03,0:14:16.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm assuming\Nthat you're travelers.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.00,0:14:20.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You must be exhausted from\Nall the time spent in that heat.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.51,0:14:24.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but this town\Nis a bit dried up, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.91,0:14:28.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have much relief to offer.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.41,0:14:31.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But still, you're free to rest here for a while.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.42,0:14:36.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We may not have much water,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.35,0:14:38.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but there are plenty of inns here in the town.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.87,0:14:40.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's what we've prided\Nourselves so much on,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.81,0:14:42.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.41,0:14:44.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but we came\Nhere because we thought
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.51,0:14:47.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the rebel army was in this town.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.61,0:14:49.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What business do you\Nhave with the rebel army?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:49.94,0:14:51.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Curse all of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.44,0:14:52.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're here to join the rebel army,
Dialogue: 50,0:14:53.02,0:14:55.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you can just go back where you came from!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.43,0:15:01.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for\Nthose fools, look elsewhere.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.80,0:15:04.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're no longer in this town.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.45,0:15:06.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, they're gone?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.51,0:15:08.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They left?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.78,0:15:10.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you noticed
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.61,0:15:13.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the town was just\Nhit by a sandstorm.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.34,0:15:15.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But that one certainly wasn't the first.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.48,0:15:17.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After three years of no rain,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.79,0:15:20.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the land has become increasingly dry.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.52,0:15:23.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sandstorms became a regular occurrence here.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:23.85,0:15:25.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Little by little,\Nthe oasis that we knew
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:27.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,was swallowed up.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:27.73,0:15:30.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Until the town became what you see now.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.38,0:15:32.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A dying wasteland.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.74,0:15:35.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With the flow of supplies to the town ended,
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.38,0:15:38.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the rebel army couldn't maintain\Ntheir drawn-out struggle.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.48,0:15:40.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So they packed up.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.38,0:15:41.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They've moved on.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:41.63,0:15:44.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The rebel base is now located in Katorea.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.99,0:15:47.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Katorea?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.72,0:15:48.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Um, where's that?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:48.89,0:15:51.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is Katorea close to here, Vivi?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.06,0:15:53.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's near Nanohana.\NBack the way we came from.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.10,0:15:55.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, great.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.17,0:15:58.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Coming all this way was just a waste of time.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.57,0:16:01.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi. Wait, your name's...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.11,0:16:04.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on! She's definitely\Nnot a princess!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.04,0:16:05.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nice one, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.30,0:16:09.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi?\NIs that really you?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:11.36,0:16:13.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're alive!\NI can't believe it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:13.83,0:16:15.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.70,0:16:19.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's me, Vivi.\NDon't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.62,0:16:21.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I look different.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.69,0:16:24.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I lost some weight, I suppose.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.10,0:16:26.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Toto! Is it really you?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.09,0:16:30.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.47,0:16:36.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.98,0:16:43.61,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,So long, my princess.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.61,0:16:45.95,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,We won't see you for a while.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.95,0:16:47.62,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,As soon as Yuba's\Nup and running,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.66,0:16:49.13,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,stop by, Princess.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.14,0:16:51.04,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course I will, Toto.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.64,0:16:56.44,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Yuba is going to do\Na great deal for this dry,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.48,0:16:57.98,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,desert country of ours.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.81,0:17:01.98,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.65,0:17:13.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Toto? That's this guy?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.96,0:17:16.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever it's worth, Vivi dear,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.00,0:17:19.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I have faith in you and the king.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.50,0:17:23.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a good man.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.54,0:17:26.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A true king who would\Nnever betray his country.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.94,0:17:28.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.24,0:18:01.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This rebellion is ridiculous!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.12,0:18:04.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A bunch of faithless fools.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:05.82,0:18:06.99,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,See ya, Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.99,0:18:09.73,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope ya grow up to become\Na great princess someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:10.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,'Kay!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.21,0:18:47.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We-We need help!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.48,0:18:48.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our village has dried up!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.98,0:18:51.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How can you sit there\Nand do nothing?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.32,0:18:54.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Weather is beyond my control as king.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:54.59,0:18:56.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I cannot command nature.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.38,0:19:00.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It is beyond any man's power.\NThere's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.22,0:19:03.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My dad always told me\Nthe king's power is limitless...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.10,0:19:04.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,he can do anything he wishes!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.93,0:19:07.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My abilities exist only in the realm of men.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.26,0:19:08.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not some kind of god...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.49,0:19:09.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.45,0:19:11.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This boy's father's\Ncome to the palace!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.99,0:19:14.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My deepest apologizes,\NYour Majesty! It's my fault.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.59,0:19:16.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Forgive my stupid son, Sire!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.40,0:19:19.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Place the punishment\Nfor his actions on me!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.15,0:19:21.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll accept any penalties!\NIt's my fault!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.55,0:19:24.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.35,0:19:25.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.55,0:19:26.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.89,0:19:30.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're stupid, insolent,\Nthoughtless...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.91,0:19:31.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,An idiot!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.61,0:19:34.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your name is Toto, is it not?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.94,0:19:35.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.01,0:19:38.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will officially grant\Ntemporary sanctuary
Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.18,0:19:40.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to any villagers who are\Nsuffering due to the crisis
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:41.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,caused by this drought.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.80,0:19:43.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to live here.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.47,0:19:47.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alubarna is a fine place for you to plan for your future.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.24,0:19:49.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, we appreciate\Nyour benevolence, King!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.94,0:19:53.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sire!\NThank you, Sire!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.95,0:19:56.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whatever! I don't wanna\Nlive in this stupid capital!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.01,0:19:58.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that the best you\Ncan do for us?!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.08,0:20:00.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, Koza! Get back here!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:02.59,0:20:03.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. Toto.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:04.12,0:20:06.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sire! As you say!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.35,0:20:07.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your son's comments
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.19,0:20:10.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,represent the people's\Nfrustrations.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:10.00,0:20:11.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's a good boy.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.23,0:20:14.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He cares for those who suffer.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.10,0:20:17.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That is why he is acting in such a way.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.83,0:20:23.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey there, crybaby.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.74,0:20:28.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did you say to me, midget?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:28.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Midget?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.75,0:20:30.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,King Cobra.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.25,0:20:31.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Igaram, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.72,0:20:32.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With all due respect,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.82,0:20:35.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,it's unrealistic to think\Nwe can support them all,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.52,0:20:37.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,not without exhausting\Nour funds, Sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.02,0:20:39.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.19,0:20:41.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We will bear the burden of\Nthis crisis with our people.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:41.52,0:20:43.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Their pleas will not be ignored.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.55,0:20:47.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I understand. As you wish.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.12,0:20:48.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's terrible.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.16,0:20:50.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!\NIt's Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:52.91,0:20:55.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I fought with that boy,\Nand got beaten.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.58,0:20:57.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(452.5,1053)}– Vivi!\N– Ah! Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.81,0:20:59.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How dare a commoner lay even a finger
Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.71,0:21:00.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,on a member of this\Nesteemed house.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.05,0:21:01.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That boy's dead!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.92,0:21:04.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No! Wait! Igaram,\Nyou must calm down!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.75,0:21:07.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,\Nmy deepest apologies!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.76,0:21:10.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Please, Sire, kill me instead!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.56,0:21:12.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're both idiots!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.57,0:21:20.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You fools. It was a\Nchildren's quarrel!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.62,0:21:32.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fruit on sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.09,0:21:33.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fight! Fight!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.26,0:21:39.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Teach that snotty princess\Na lesson! Take her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.40,0:21:41.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Go, Vivi! Beat him.\N– Go, Vivi! Beat him.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.40,0:21:42.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up, traitors!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.44,0:21:45.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't ya know we're supposed\Nto cheer for Koza?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.78,0:21:53.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I become your leader when I\Nbeat you, that's the deal!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.29,0:21:55.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd never lose\Na fight to you, midget!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.72,0:21:59.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never lost a fight.\NEspecially to a dumb girl!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:00.66,0:22:01.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.75,0:22:07.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– You can do it, Koza! Fight!\N– You can do it, Koza! Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:09.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– Go, Princess, go!\N– Go, Princess, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.81,0:22:19.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,All right, you guys, listen up!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.70,0:22:22.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As of today, Princess\NVivi will be vice-leader
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.47,0:22:23.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,of the Sand-Sand Clan!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.84,0:22:25.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does anyone have a\Nproblem with that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.64,0:22:29.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}– No!\N– No!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:29.28,0:22:31.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Look, Igaram.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.72,0:22:34.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi has made some new friends.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.49,0:22:35.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, Sire.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:35.39,0:22:37.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That is the most important thing to have
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.34,0:22:40.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,if she's to rule Alabasta in my stead.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.18,0:22:42.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The people must follow her.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.86,0:22:52.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Toto! Ma'am!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.77,0:22:54.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good morning! Where's Leader?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.83,0:22:56.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.57,0:22:59.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for Koza, he already left.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.11,0:23:01.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I assume he's at the usual spot.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.30,0:23:03.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See ya later!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.31,0:23:06.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vivi! You coming for lunch?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.35,0:23:09.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, please!\NThank you very much!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.59,0:23:11.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a strange country we live in.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.89,0:23:14.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The princess mingling\Nwith commoners like us,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.76,0:23:16.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,who would've ever thought?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.47,0:23:19.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A sign of peaceful times.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.37,0:23:21.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And will you be joining us?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.34,0:23:23.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No, no, that's quite all right.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.06,0:23:25.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I packed a lunch today. Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.27,0:23:34.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.57,0:23:38.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! What are\Nyou doing here?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.08,0:23:41.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cobra! My lord! Ugh...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.38,0:23:43.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I asked you not to\Nfollow me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.77,0:23:45.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's just,
Dialogue: 50,0:23:45.33,0:23:48.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wanted to make sure my\Nprecious daughter's okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:50.28,0:23:51.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go home, Sire!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.21,0:23:53.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't babysit you and Princess Vivi, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.78,0:23:55.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.22,0:23:56.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(1850,2810,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Go home!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.19,0:23:57.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\t(1850,2810,\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}You heard me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.56,0:24:09.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a sweet story, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.80,0:24:11.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy, stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.70,0:24:13.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hello, Princess!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.53,0:24:17.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You lost, little girl?\NWe'll help you out.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:19.64,0:24:21.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Protect her, Sand-Sand Clan!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.31,0:24:25.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the hell's\Nwrong with these kids?!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.36,0:24:27.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.94,0:24:29.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Leader! Guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.64,0:24:30.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi! Get going!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:30.74,0:24:33.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're trying to hold these\Nguys off for you! Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.08,0:24:34.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Vivi, get outta here right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.98,0:24:36.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you gotta run, now!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:36.59,0:24:38.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I can't... Leader!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.71,0:24:41.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're not here to kill you.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.87,0:24:45.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We just wanna kidnap you for\Na ransom from your father,
Dialogue: 50,0:24:45.14,0:24:47.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but these other kids...
Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.24,0:24:50.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.08,0:24:53.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay. Now just come with\Nus quietly, Princess Vivi.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:57.88,0:24:59.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Step back!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:59.55,0:25:01.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Protect her to the death,\NSand-Sand Clan!
